 "text": "Hi, how's everything with you? Not at all. Many people start when they' well into their busy years. How much time do you want to commit each day? Five minutes is plenty for a few weeks. Then start with simple words and only a few phrases. The brain still recognizes patterns. Portuguese is lovely, and you already have the bonus of recognizing Spanish words. Greek is great if you like the sound of it, though it' more challenging. An app like Duolingo is friendly and gives you a bit of language and culture every day. Or you can buy a textbook and learn with lessons online. The key is practice. Ten minutes a day is enough for now.",
